# Copy to .env.publish (gitignored) and fill in. Never commit the real file.
# Only for publishing by hand. Releases normally go through
# .github/workflows/publish.yml, which needs no tokens (trusted publishing).
# See "Publishing" in DEVELOPING.md.

# VS Code Marketplace. Azure DevOps personal access token, scoped
# Marketplace -> Manage, organization "All accessible organizations".
# Azure DevOps stops accepting these global PATs on 2026-12-01; after that,
# publish by hand by uploading the .vsix on the publisher management page.
VSCE_PAT=

# Open VSX. Token from https://open-vsx.org -> your profile -> Access Tokens
# (shown once at creation). Requires the Eclipse Publisher Agreement to be
# signed first, or publishing fails with a 403.
OVSX_PAT=
